            "line": 64,
            "text": "def majorArcs (δ₀ r x : ℝ) : Set ℝ :=\n  (⋃ (q : ℕ) (_ : 1 ≤ q ∧ (q : ℝ) ≤ r ∧ Odd q) (a : ℤ) (_ : IsCoprime a (q : ℤ)),\n      Set.Ioo (a / q - δ₀ * r / (2 * q * x)) (a / q + δ₀ * r / (2 * q * x))) ∪\n  (⋃ (q : ℕ) (_ : 1 ≤ q ∧ (q : ℝ) ≤ 2 * r ∧ Even q) (a : ℤ) (_ : IsCoprime a (q : ℤ)),\n      Set.Ioo (a / q - δ₀ * r / (q * x)) (a / q + δ₀ * r / (q * x)))",
            "truncated": false
          }
