  "note": "As [H] (12.1), up to notation. With Q0 in place of r, δ0Q0² ≤ x/2 makes the arcs disjoint mod 1: the half-widths at a/q and a'/q' sum to (q+q')δ0Q0/(qq'x) ≤ 1/(qq').",
